    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This novel is still in development. It will be available for Windows. It will maybe be available for Mac as well, but that will require some testing first.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399200/extras/a7ec147ca94b9d482dfcc13e45f4b4df.webp?t=1754580113\" width=532 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Billie Beetleneck: A detective tale is a visual novel about a beetle trying to solve his hardest case yet. An unusual number of booklice and humans have escaped their worlds to seek refuge in Bugtown due to a large number of attacks from bookworms.<br>Bookworms feed on knowledge by eating up pages of various books and destroying the worlds within in the process. Characters inside the books must flee, or perish during such devastating attacks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399200/extras/627a18d9d6b818745f71bee6d741dc81.webp?t=1754580113\" width=532 height=48 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A detective story with some player choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful visuals and characters in anime style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playtime of: TBA</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399200/extras/1061520167ece59ad2c6b7f00d06a0f8.webp?t=1754580113\" width=532 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399200/extras/6211d1e08eafe5dc6283ffbed7b3447e.avif?t=1754580113\" width=355 height=766 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399200/extras/a7ec147ca94b9d482dfcc13e45f4b4df.webp?t=1754580113\" width=532 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Billie Beetleneck: A detective tale is a visual novel about a beetle trying to solve his hardest case yet. An unusual number of booklice and humans have escaped their worlds to seek refuge in Bugtown due to a large number of attacks from bookworms.<br>Bookworms feed on knowledge by eating up pages of various books and destroying the worlds within in the process. Characters inside the books must flee, or perish during such devastating attacks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399200/extras/627a18d9d6b818745f71bee6d741dc81.webp?t=1754580113\" width=532 height=48 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A detective story with some player choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful visuals and characters in anime style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playtime of: TBA</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399200/extras/1061520167ece59ad2c6b7f00d06a0f8.webp?t=1754580113\" width=532 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399200/extras/6211d1e08eafe5dc6283ffbed7b3447e.avif?t=1754580113\" width=355 height=766 /></span></p>",
